      "side": 1,
      "message": "code for this has moved in aosp/1952390 as a following change. Since you ask for a first CL without changing the test code.\nBut to address the comment:\nI added `MODULE_LIBRARIES`\n\nI don\u0027t think there is any valid reason to put this as a public API. Bluetooth is the only caller and I don\u0027t see how this should be call by someone else. For the same reason, I don\u0027t have any permission in mind that we should use here.\nWould a `@RequireNoPermission` be useful ? Linter does not complain to not have anything.",
