      "writtenOn": "2022-01-18T23:55:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we can release an API (even a module-lib API) that might (non-deterministically) close the object that is passed in. Such an API would be very difficult to use correctly. That would result in hard-to-find bugs.\n\nWhat was the error you got when you used FileDescriptor?",
